    '**THE ONE THAT WORRIES ME MOST.** **The settlement definition for the Cyprus interconnect differs from the other eight: minutes are rounded up at their gateway and not ours, agreed verbally in 2022 with their settlements manager, who has since left that company.** **It is in no file of ours and probably none of theirs.** **To: H. Deeb and the definition register, by 20 November — and a letter to Cyprus Telecom asking them to confirm it in writing, which is the real fix and which I should have done in 2022.**',
