      b: 'Fourth: the Zhongtai recommendation, about 9 million and a failed commissioning, with what changed afterwards — and the gap named first, no capital budget and no chaired board item. A reader who sees no mistake assumes inexperience or concealment, and a candidate who claims the whole post is found out at the second interview.',
